{"seq":4,"slug":"observability-monitoring","title":"可观测性与监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/harness-and-orchestration/observability-monitoring","wordCount":1581,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"可观测性与监控\">可观测性与监控</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ML 系统的可观测性（Observability）是通过外部输出（指标、日志、追踪）来理解系统内部状态的能力。与传统软件系统不同，ML 系统的&quot;正确性&quot;不仅取决于代码逻辑，还取决于数据质量和模型行为——这两者都会随时间变化。因此，ML 可观测性需要在传统的系统监控之上，增加数据监控和模型监控两个维度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[ML 可观测性] --&gt; B[系统监控]&#10;    A --&gt; C[数据监控]&#10;    A --&gt; D[模型监控]&#10;    B --&gt; E[延迟/吞吐/错误率]&#10;    C --&gt; F[数据漂移/质量/Schema]&#10;    D --&gt; G[性能退化/偏差/公平性]&#10;    E --&gt; H[告警系统]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[自动响应]\">graph TB\n    A[ML 可观测性] --&gt; B[系统监控]\n    A --&gt; C[数据监控]\n    A --&gt; D[模型监控]\n    B --&gt; E[延迟/吞吐/错误率]\n    C --&gt; F[数据漂移/质量/Schema]\n    D --&gt; G[性能退化/偏差/公平性]\n    E --&gt; H[告警系统]\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[自动响应]</pre><p>三个层面的监控形成了 ML 系统可观测性的完整图景。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>监控层面</th>\n<th>监控对象</th>\n<th>核心指标</th>\n<th>更新频率</th>\n<th>异常响应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>系统监控</td>\n<td>基础设施和服务</td>\n<td>CPU/GPU/内存使用率、延迟、QPS</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n<td>自动扩缩容/告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据监控</td>\n<td>输入数据</td>\n<td>特征分布、空值率、Schema 变更</td>\n<td>批次/实时</td>\n<td>阻断流水线/告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型监控</td>\n<td>模型行为</td>\n<td>预测分布、准确率、漂移指标</td>\n<td>小时/天</td>\n<td>触发重训练/告警</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"数据漂移检测\">数据漂移检测</h2><p>数据漂移（Data Drift）是指生产环境中的数据分布相比训练数据发生了变化。数据漂移是模型性能退化最常见的根因，因为模型在训练数据分布上学习的模式可能在新分布上不再适用。</p>\n<p>数据漂移分为三种类型：协变量漂移（Covariate Drift，输入特征分布变化）、先验概率漂移（Prior Probability Drift，标签分布变化）和概念漂移（Concept Drift，输入与输出之间的关系变化）。三种漂移的检测方法和应对策略各不相同。</p>\n<p>统计检验是检测协变量漂移的标准方法。对于数值特征，可以使用 KS 检验（Kolmogorov-Smirnov Test）比较两个分布的差异，或计算 PSI（Population Stability Index）量化分布偏移程度。对于类别特征，可以使用卡方检验（Chi-Square Test）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from scipy import stats&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;class DriftDetector:&#10;    def __init__(self, reference_data, threshold=0.05):&#10;        self.reference = reference_data&#10;        self.threshold = threshold&#10;&#10;    def detect_drift(self, production_data):&#10;        drift_report = {}&#10;        for feature in self.reference.columns:&#10;            ref_values = self.reference[feature].dropna()&#10;            prod_values = production_data[feature].dropna()&#10;&#10;            if ref_values.dtype in [np.float64, np.int64]:&#10;                statistic, p_value = stats.ks_2samp(ref_values, prod_values)&#10;                psi = self._calculate_psi(ref_values, prod_values)&#10;                drift_report[feature] = {&#10;                    &quot;ks_statistic&quot;: statistic,&#10;                    &quot;p_value&quot;: p_value,&#10;                    &quot;psi&quot;: psi,&#10;                    &quot;drifted&quot;: p_value &lt; self.threshold or psi &gt; 0.2,&#10;                }&#10;        return drift_report&#10;&#10;    def _calculate_psi(self, reference, production, bins=10):&#10;        ref_hist, edges = np.histogram(reference, bins=bins)&#10;        prod_hist, _ = np.histogram(production, bins=edges)&#10;        ref_pct = ref_hist / len(reference) + 1e-6&#10;        prod_pct = prod_hist / len(production) + 1e-6&#10;        psi = np.sum((prod_pct - ref_pct) * np.log(prod_pct / ref_pct))&#10;        return psi\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scipy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stats</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DriftDetector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, reference_data, threshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.reference </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reference_data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.threshold </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> threshold</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> detect_drift</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, production_data):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        drift_report </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> feature </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.reference.columns:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            ref_values </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.reference[feature].dropna()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            prod_values </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> production_data[feature].dropna()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ref_values.dtype </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [np.float64, np.int64]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                statistic, p_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stats.ks_2samp(ref_values, prod_values)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                psi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._calculate_psi(ref_values, prod_values)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                drift_report[feature] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                    \"ks_statistic\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: statistic,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                    \"p_value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: p_value,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                    \"psi\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: psi,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                    \"drifted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: p_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.threshold </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> psi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> drift_report</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> _calculate_psi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, reference, production, bins</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ref_hist, edges </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.histogram(reference, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bins</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bins)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        prod_hist, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.histogram(production, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bins</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">edges)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ref_pct </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ref_hist </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(reference) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1e-6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        prod_pct </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prod_hist </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(production) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1e-6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        psi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.sum((prod_pct </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ref_pct) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.log(prod_pct </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ref_pct))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> psi</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Evidently AI 和 WhyLabs 是专门的 ML 监控工具，它们提供了开箱即用的漂移检测、数据质量分析和模型性能报告。Evidently 可以生成交互式的漂移分析报告，WhyLabs 提供了实时的数据 Profiling 和告警能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[生产数据] --&gt; B[特征 Profiling]&#10;    B --&gt; C[统计检验]&#10;    C --&gt; D{漂移检测}&#10;    D --&gt;|无漂移| E[继续监控]&#10;    D --&gt;|轻微漂移| F[告警通知]&#10;    D --&gt;|严重漂移| G[触发重训练]\">graph LR\n    A[生产数据] --&gt; B[特征 Profiling]\n    B --&gt; C[统计检验]\n    C --&gt; D{漂移检测}\n    D --&gt;|无漂移| E[继续监控]\n    D --&gt;|轻微漂移| F[告警通知]\n    D --&gt;|严重漂移| G[触发重训练]</pre><h2 id=\"模型性能退化监控\">模型性能退化监控</h2><p>模型性能退化（Model Degradation）是指模型在生产环境中的预测质量随时间下降。退化的原因可能是数据漂移、数据质量问题、上游系统变更或业务环境变化。</p>\n<p>直接的性能监控需要真实标签（Ground Truth），但在很多场景中标签获取有延迟。例如，推荐系统的点击标签在推荐展示后立即可得，但电商的购买标签可能在数天后才能确认。因此，需要设计代理指标（Proxy Metrics）来提前发现退化趋势。</p>\n<p>常用的代理指标包括：预测分布漂移（模型输出的概率分布与历史模式的偏差）、预测置信度分布（平均置信度显著下降可能暗示模型困惑）、特征重要性变化（特征对预测的贡献度与训练时不一致）和预测一致性（相似输入产生不一致的预测结果）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class ModelMonitor:&#10;    def __init__(self, baseline_predictions):&#10;        self.baseline = baseline_predictions&#10;        self.metrics_history = []&#10;&#10;    def check_prediction_drift(self, current_predictions):&#10;        baseline_dist = np.histogram(self.baseline, bins=50, density=True)[0]&#10;        current_dist = np.histogram(current_predictions, bins=50, density=True)[0]&#10;&#10;        kl_divergence = stats.entropy(current_dist + 1e-10, baseline_dist + 1e-10)&#10;        js_divergence = self._jensen_shannon(baseline_dist, current_dist)&#10;&#10;        return {&#10;            &quot;kl_divergence&quot;: kl_divergence,&#10;            &quot;js_divergence&quot;: js_divergence,&#10;            &quot;mean_shift&quot;: np.mean(current_predictions) - np.mean(self.baseline),&#10;            &quot;std_shift&quot;: np.std(current_predictions) - np.std(self.baseline),&#10;        }&#10;&#10;    def check_confidence_distribution(self, confidences):&#10;        avg_confidence = np.mean(confidences)&#10;        low_confidence_ratio = np.mean(confidences &lt; 0.5)&#10;        return {&#10;            &quot;avg_confidence&quot;: avg_confidence,&#10;            &quot;low_confidence_ratio&quot;: low_confidence_ratio,&#10;            &quot;alert&quot;: low_confidence_ratio &gt; 0.3,&#10;        }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ModelMonitor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, baseline_predictions):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.baseline </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> baseline_predictions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.metrics_history </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> check_prediction_drift</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, current_predictions):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        baseline_dist </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.histogram(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.baseline, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bins</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">density</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        current_dist </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.histogram(current_predictions, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bins</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">density</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        kl_divergence </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stats.entropy(current_dist </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1e-10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, baseline_dist </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1e-10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        js_divergence </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._jensen_shannon(baseline_dist, current_dist)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"kl_divergence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: kl_divergence,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"js_divergence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: js_divergence,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"mean_shift\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: np.mean(current_predictions) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.mean(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.baseline),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"std_shift\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: np.std(current_predictions) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.std(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.baseline),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> check_confidence_distribution</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, confidences):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        avg_confidence </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.mean(confidences)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        low_confidence_ratio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.mean(confidences </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"avg_confidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: avg_confidence,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"low_confidence_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: low_confidence_ratio,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"alert\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: low_confidence_ratio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当确认模型性能退化后，响应策略按严重程度递进：轻微退化时增加监控频率和粒度，中度退化时触发自动重训练流水线，严重退化时切换到备用模型或降级方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分布式追踪与日志管理\">分布式追踪与日志管理</h2><p>ML 系统的请求链路通常跨越多个服务：API 网关 → 特征服务 → 模型推理 → 后处理 → 响应返回。分布式追踪（Distributed Tracing）通过在整个链路中传递唯一的 Trace ID 和 Span ID，将分散在不同服务中的日志和指标关联为一条完整的调用链。</p>\n<p>OpenTelemetry 是分布式追踪的开放标准，它提供了统一的 API 来生成 Trace、Metric 和 Log 数据，支持导出到 Jaeger、Zipkin、Prometheus 等多种后端。对于 ML 服务，需要在追踪中记录推理相关的元数据：使用的模型版本、输入特征的摘要、推理延迟的分解（预处理时间 + 推理时间 + 后处理时间）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from opentelemetry import trace&#10;&#10;tracer = trace.get_tracer(&quot;ml-inference-service&quot;)&#10;&#10;async def predict_endpoint(request):&#10;    with tracer.start_as_current_span(&quot;predict&quot;) as span:&#10;        span.set_attribute(&quot;model.name&quot;, request.model_name)&#10;        span.set_attribute(&quot;model.version&quot;, request.model_version)&#10;&#10;        with tracer.start_as_current_span(&quot;feature_retrieval&quot;):&#10;            features = await get_features(request)&#10;            span.set_attribute(&quot;features.count&quot;, len(features))&#10;&#10;        with tracer.start_as_current_span(&quot;model_inference&quot;):&#10;            result = await run_inference(features)&#10;            span.set_attribute(&quot;inference.latency_ms&quot;, result.latency_ms)&#10;            span.set_attribute(&quot;prediction.confidence&quot;, result.confidence)&#10;&#10;        return result\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> opentelemetry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tracer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace.get_tracer(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ml-inference-service\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> predict_endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracer.start_as_current_span(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"predict\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> span:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        span.set_attribute(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"model.name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, request.model_name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        span.set_attribute(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"model.version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, request.model_version)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracer.start_as_current_span(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"feature_retrieval\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_features(request)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            span.set_attribute(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"features.count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(features))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracer.start_as_current_span(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"model_inference\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> run_inference(features)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            span.set_attribute(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"inference.latency_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, result.latency_ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            span.set_attribute(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"prediction.confidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, result.confidence)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>追踪维度</th>\n<th>记录内容</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>请求级</td>\n<td>Trace ID, 客户端 ID, 请求时间</td>\n<td>问题排查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型级</td>\n<td>模型名称, 版本, 推理延迟</td>\n<td>性能分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征级</td>\n<td>特征来源, 获取延迟, 缺失率</td>\n<td>特征问题定位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据级</td>\n<td>输入摘要, 输出分布</td>\n<td>漂移分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"告警体系与自动响应\">告警体系与自动响应</h2><p>告警体系是可观测性的最后一环，它将监控数据转化为可操作的通知和自动化响应。ML 系统的告警设计需要特别注意告警疲劳——过多的低优先级告警会导致团队忽视真正重要的告警。</p>\n<p>告警分级是应对告警疲劳的核心策略。P0 告警（服务不可用、严重数据泄漏）需要立即响应，通过电话和 PagerDuty 通知值班人员。P1 告警（模型性能显著退化、资源瓶颈）在工作时间内处理，通过 Slack 通知团队。P2 告警（轻微漂移、非关键指标波动）在周报中审视，通过邮件通知。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[监控指标] --&gt; B{阈值判断}&#10;    B --&gt;|P0 严重| C[PagerDuty 电话]&#10;    B --&gt;|P1 重要| D[Slack 通知]&#10;    B --&gt;|P2 信息| E[邮件汇总]&#10;    C --&gt; F[自动响应]&#10;    F --&gt; G[自动回滚]&#10;    F --&gt; H[自动扩容]&#10;    F --&gt; I[触发重训练]\">graph TB\n    A[监控指标] --&gt; B{阈值判断}\n    B --&gt;|P0 严重| C[PagerDuty 电话]\n    B --&gt;|P1 重要| D[Slack 通知]\n    B --&gt;|P2 信息| E[邮件汇总]\n    C --&gt; F[自动响应]\n    F --&gt; G[自动回滚]\n    F --&gt; H[自动扩容]\n    F --&gt; I[触发重训练]</pre><p>自动响应（Auto-Remediation）减少了人工干预的需求。常见的自动响应包括：推理延迟超标时自动扩容、模型错误率飙升时自动回滚到上一版本、数据漂移检测到异常时自动触发重训练流水线、GPU 内存泄漏时自动重启推理服务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((可观测性与监控))&#10;    三层监控&#10;      系统监控&#10;      数据监控&#10;      模型监控&#10;    漂移检测&#10;      协变量漂移&#10;      概念漂移&#10;      PSI/KS 检验&#10;    追踪日志&#10;      OpenTelemetry&#10;      分布式追踪&#10;      结构化日志&#10;    告警响应&#10;      分级告警&#10;      自动回滚&#10;      自动重训练\">mindmap\n  root((可观测性与监控))\n    三层监控\n      系统监控\n      数据监控\n      模型监控\n    漂移检测\n      协变量漂移\n      概念漂移\n      PSI/KS 检验\n    追踪日志\n      OpenTelemetry\n      分布式追踪\n      结构化日志\n    告警响应\n      分级告警\n      自动回滚\n      自动重训练</pre><ul>\n<li>ML 可观测性在传统系统监控之上增加了数据监控和模型监控两个维度</li>\n<li>数据漂移检测是发现模型性能退化的前导指标，PSI 和 KS 检验是常用的统计方法</li>\n<li>分布式追踪将跨服务的请求链路关联为完整的调用链，是问题排查的核心工具</li>\n<li>告警分级和自动响应是防止告警疲劳和加速故障恢复的关键设计</li>\n<li>模型性能退化的监控需要在标签延迟的情况下借助代理指标提前预警</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可观测性与监控","id":"可观测性与监控"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"数据漂移检测","id":"数据漂移检测"},{"level":2,"text":"模型性能退化监控","id":"模型性能退化监控"},{"level":2,"text":"分布式追踪与日志管理","id":"分布式追踪与日志管理"},{"level":2,"text":"告警体系与自动响应","id":"告警体系与自动响应"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"中间件模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/harness-and-orchestration/middleware-patterns"},"next":{"title":"AutoML 系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/automl-and-platforms/automl-systems"}}